<title>ROMANIA: Romanian retail sales rise 4.2 pct in August.</title>
<headline>Romanian retail sales rise 4.2 pct in August.</headline>
<dateline>BUCHAREST 1996-09-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>The National Statistics Board (CNS) reported the following economic indicator details:</p>
<p> ROMANIAN RETAIL SALES     AUGUST    JULY    AUGUST 95</p>
<p> volume bln ROL	     2,006.3   1,839.9    1,439.3</p>
<p> pct change mth/mth	    +4.2	-0.4	+11.2</p>
<p> pct change yr/yr		+6.5     +12.8	+22.0</p>
<p> private sector pct share    77.9	77.9	 71.0</p>
<p>CUMULATIVE FIGURES (JAN TO MONTH)</p>
<p> volume bln ROL	    13,673.1  11,666.8    9,441.0</p>
<p> pct change yr/yr	     +16.3     +18.0	+26.8</p>
<p> private sector pct share    79.2	79.5	 69.8</p>
<p>NOTES -- Year-on-year and month-on-month changes in comparable prices. -- Bucharest Newsroom 40-1 3120264</p>
</text>
